cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to the IP Operations Protocol, please cite it by name and version as below."
type: software
title: "IP Operations Protocol"
abstract: >-
  A standard for operational data exchange between actors working on patent and
  other IP assets: the messages exchanged when work is done on an asset, from
  bootstrapping it from a register to requesting, instructing, invoicing and
  paying for work, with JSON Schemas and validated examples. The specification
  text is licensed under CC-BY-4.0; the JSON Schemas, examples and reference
  validator under schemas/ are licensed under Apache-2.0. The maintainer has made
  the Open Web Foundation Agreement 1.0 for the specification (see PATENTS.md).
authors:
  - given-names: Jonas
    family-names: Block
version: "0.9.1"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/GregXIV/ip-operations-protocol"
url: "https://guardianlabs.io"
keywords:
  - intellectual property
  - patents
  - data exchange
  - JSON Schema
  - WIPO standards
  - open standard
